[en.FOCUS_C09_FREE_TRADE]
Free Trade

[en.FOCUS_C09_FREE_TRADE_desc]
“The great virtue of a free market system is that it does not care what species they are; it does not care what their cutie mark is; it only cares whether they can produce something you want to buy.” —— Milton Friedpony, Sire’s Hollow economist

[zh.FOCUS_C09_FREE_TRADE]
自由贸易

[zh.FOCUS_C09_FREE_TRADE_desc]
“自由市场体系的伟大优点在于它不在乎他们是什么物种；它不在乎他们的可爱标志是什么；它只在乎他们是否能生产出你想买的东西。” —— 米尔顿·弗里德驹，名流谷经济学家

